ProjectALife.DialogueShards["barks_enc_2"] = {
{"ENC_SILENCE_LAST","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I'm counting in my head and I'm almost out. Talk","Talk to me, right now - I can't keep waiting on you","Answer me or I'll - I don't know. Just answer","Say something. My hands aren't steady, and that's bad for you","One more time, then we're done being polite","Don't make me do this! Answer me!","Please, say something, you're scaring us"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE_LAST","reg=law",{"Last chance to talk this out. Use it","Your quiet is telling me plenty. Say something","Don't make me decide for you. Talk!","Say it now, or I figure you've got something to hide","Answer me! Anything! Just open your mouth!","Damn it, say something! Don't make this go the hard way","I'm not asking again - answer me"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE_LAST","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Final chance. Talk, or we're done talking","You've got about one breath left. Use it","Say something. Anything. Before somebody here gets twitchy","Nothing? Then I'm done being patient","Answer me. The next thing I say won't be a question","Decide. Words or trouble, but decide now","Last time, answer the question"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE_LAST","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Last time, friend. After this I stop asking and start deciding","Ain't waiting forever. Say something or I decide what your silence means","My smile's getting tired. Talk!","Final chance to be interesting","Silence is an answer too, you know... and I don't care for it","I'm counting. One... two...","I don't like asking twice - don't make me ask three times"}},
{"ENC_SILENCE_LAST","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"I'm out of patience. Answer, or I start on your knees","Open your mouth or I'll open it for you","Last time I'm nice about it. Talk","Quiet, huh? Quiet's an answer, and I don't like it","Nobody gets this many chances from me. Talk!","Boys, looks like {he}'s not talking","Say something - last chance"}},
{"ENC_STALL","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Nice boots. Where'd you come by those? Tell me the whole story","Long walk, huh? Your feet must be killing you","You know, you remind me of somebody. Hold still, it'll come to me","Anybody waiting on you somewhere? Go on, tell me about them","Easy now, nobody needs to get hurt, just keep talking to me","Relax - look at me, not at him, we're just talking"}},
{"ENC_STALL","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Where you hail from, anyway? Bardstown? Take your time","Keep your eyes right here, buddy. I'm the interesting one","Hell of a mess out here. You seen anybody worth knowing?","Nice boots. What'd you pay for those? Nah, I'm just talking","Hey, hey, eyes on me, we're all friends here","Just stand still a minute, we're almost done"}},
{"ENC_SURPRISE","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hey! You there! Hold it, I mean it!","Oh God, who's that? Stay put, stay put!","Don't - don't move. Please. Let me think a second","Damn, you scared the life out of me! Freeze!","Easy! Easy now - I see you, so just stand there","Is that a person? Hold up - stay where you are!","Whoa- stop right there! Not one step closer!","Oh Lord, there's somebody here - don't move!"}},
{"ENC_SURPRISE","reg=law",{"Whoa, whoa! Stand still, I mean it!","Deputy! Not another step, arms out from your sides!","Don't you reach for anything! Stay right there!","Stop where you are. I've chased enough people this week","Police! Stop and keep your hands up and empty!","Easy now. Easy. Stay right there for me","Sheriff's department! Freeze! Let me see your hands!","Hold it right there! Hands where I can see them!"}},
{"ENC_SURPRISE","reg=swat,military,elite",{"Halt! Hands out from your sides, slow!","Easy... don't run, don't turn. Just stand there","Hold it right there. Show me both hands","Whoa- stay put! Anything on your hip stays on your hip!","Somebody's right there! You, don't move, don't move!","Not one more step. Keep your hands clear of your belt","Trouble! You, stop! Show me your hands!","Freeze! Don't you move a muscle!"}},
{"ENC_SURPRISE","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Hold up, stranger, hold up - no sense turning this into a funeral","Easy now. Quick hands make my people jumpy, and jumpy people do dumb things","A stranger! Stay put and keep those hands friendly","Look at you, strolling around like you own the place. Freeze!","Little far from home, ain't you? Plant your feet and stay awhile","Whoa, whoa. That's close enough, and I'd like it to stay that way","Well, well, look what we found - easy now, real slow","Don't you twitch, not one inch"}},
{"ENC_SURPRISE","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Hands! Show me hands, damn it!","Shit, where'd you come from? Don't move!","Well lookee here. Real still now, buddy","Freeze, you dumb ass!","Over here, boys! Got us a live one!","Easy, easy. One twitch and I open you up","Got one! Hey! Don't you move, you hear me?","Right there! You so much as blink, you're done!"}},
{"ENC_TURN","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"I'm sorry. God, I'm sorry. Stay back!","No more talking! Back away or we shoot!","We tried! You heard us try! Now back off!","Don't make me! Please don't make me do this!","Far enough! Not another step!","Get behind me! All of you, get behind me!","That's it! Get back! Get back!"}},
{"ENC_TURN","reg=law",{"You had your chance! Guns up!","I'm sorry it came to this. Now!","That's all the talking I've got in me","Tried it the easy way. Take the shot if you get one!","Damn it, don't make me! Last time!","Then we're done. Fire if you have to!","Alright, that's enough! Weapons up!"}},
{"ENC_TURN","reg=swat,military,elite",{"That's it. We're done talking","You did this. Weapons up, on my word","Too bad. Safeties off, everybody","Don't say we didn't ask. Weapons on that one!","Watch the hands! WATCH THE HANDS!","No more talk. You had your chance!","Hostile intent! Weapons up!"}},
{"ENC_TURN","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Pity. You almost had me smiling for real","Boys, we're done being polite","I gave you every chance. Every last one","You could have walked out of this. Now you're just in the way","That's the last time you disappoint me","Smile, friend. This part hurts","Have it your way, then","Shame, I liked you"}},
{"ENC_TURN","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Light {him} up!","I'm done talking. Take {him} down!","Should've stayed home, buddy","Okay, we tried the nice way","Shoot {him}! Shoot {him} now!","Nobody's gonna come looking for you","Wrong answer!"}},
{"ENC_WALK_AWAY","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"Hey! I wasn't finished! Come back here","Stop - don't turn your back on us!","Hold on, hold on - I've still got a question for you","Don't walk away from me like that, I've got a right to know","Wait! Please - one more thing and you can go","No, no, no - turn back around! Slowly!","Wait, where are you going? Don't just walk off!"}},
{"ENC_WALK_AWAY","reg=law",{"Where you headed? I'm not through with you!","Turn around. I said turn around!","Walking off won't help. Come back here","Don't make me come after you, my knees can't take it","Get back here, or this talk gets a whole lot shorter","Hey, did I say you could go? Stay put!","Hey! Don't you walk away from me!","Stop right there, we're not done"}},
{"ENC_WALK_AWAY","reg=swat,military,elite",{"I didn't say we were done. Get back here","Turn around. Face me, slow","Where do you think you're going? Come back!","Don't turn your back on us. Back here, easy","Hold it! Walking off isn't one of your options","Whoa, easy. Come back, nobody told you to go","Stop! Stay where you are!"}},
{"ENC_WALK_AWAY","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Where you off to in such a hurry? We were just getting acquainted","Turn around. Walking out on a talk is rude, and I take rude personal","I didn't say you could go. Come back here","Now, now. Don't turn your back on me, it makes folks nervous","Every step you take, my friends like you a little less. Come back","Hold on, we're not finished. You'll hurt my feelings","Hey, don't walk away, we ain't done talking"}},
{"ENC_WALK_AWAY","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"Hey! Did I say you could go?","Turn around. I've shot people in the back for less","Oh, we're done when I say we're done!","Walk off on me and see how far you get","Take another step, go on, I dare you","Rude. Real rude. Get back here","Where you think you're going? Get back here!"}},
{"ENC_WARNING_SHOT","reg=civilian,family,worker,rescue",{"That was me being serious. Come on out, now","Did you hear that? I'm not bluffing - please come out","I shot high on purpose. Don't make me shoot lower","Steady, everybody! It was only a warning - come out!","That was a warning! Please, just come out!"}},
{"ENC_WARNING_SHOT","reg=law",{"That's one. I'd like it to be the only one","Hear that? That one was on purpose. Back up!","I'm not fooling around out here! Stop!","That was the polite one! Stay where you are!","That's your warning shot! The next one won't be in the air!"}},
{"ENC_WARNING_SHOT","reg=swat,military,elite",{"That one went wide on purpose! The next won't!","Next one goes through you! Stay put!","Warning round! Not another inch!","Hear that? Courtesy's over. Hold still","Warning shot! Comply now!"}},
{"ENC_WARNING_SHOT","reg=outlaw,club,crime",{"Consider that me clearing my throat! Now answer","That one was free! The next one has somebody's name on it","Heard that? I'm only polite for one round","Ears open now? Good, because I don't shoot at sky twice","That one went up, the next one won't"}},
{"ENC_WARNING_SHOT","reg=raider,gang,prison",{"That one's free. The next one costs you","Take a good look at that hole. Yours is next","Still got ears? Good! Now listen!","Whoops, my finger slipped. Might slip again!","Hear that? Next one's for you!"}},
}
